junit/

# Build output (DAB builds the wheel into dist/ at deploy time)
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `build/` also matched .claude/build/ (the staged
# rebuild briefs CLAUDE.md tells every stage session to read), silently keeping them out of
# git entirely - found while reconciling those briefs against the repo in Stage 8.
/build/
dist/

